  "title": "Week 8: OpenWebUI Zotero Ollama",
  "date": "2025-02-21T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 8: OpenWebUI Zotero Ollama\n\nGodot XR Gamejam\n\nThis week is the voting week of Godot XR Gamejam 2025. I saw a lot good works.\n\nYour Hand Is A Dragon (XR), your hand is a flying dragon.\n\nA Wizards Way, XR puzzle game.\n\nThe Chant of Cthulhu, I single person choir.\n\nAgni Kairo: VR Firebending, workout game.\n\nSweep Stakes VR, VR flying broom.\n\nHigh Alchemist VR, cooking game.\n\nOpenWebUI Zotero and Ollama to build personal librarian\n\nI saw a video which talks about using zotero library and OpenWebUI and Ollama to build an agent base on your own database. I think it is super helpful.\n\nglTFfast\n\nI think this is not the first time I use it. This time I used it to export some unity 3D model. Because I need to test some model in mixamo. However, I still have to transpile it into fbx using this website.",
